          %p
            for all
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi x
                  %mo ,
                  %mi y
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x, y
            in suitable
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inner+product+spaces"} inner product spaces
            (and in fact the analogy is not idle; see for instance
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#JB97"} Baez 1997
          %p In that case, we have the following elementary inferences:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mrow
                    %mtable
