          %p
            where the first and third lines use the defining
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+property"} property
            of unions. Then, putting
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
