                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T = f\left(\bigcup_{i \in I} S_i\right)
            and reasoning backward, we get
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
