          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality"} dual
            of this proof immediately gives the fact that inverse images preserve arbitrary intersections, but let us spell it out directly:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
