                  %mi P
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi Y
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \forall_f: P(X) \to P(Y)
            preserves intersections.
          #MoreJargon.num_remark
            %h6#remark_3 Remark
            %p
              In terms of some more
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
              jargon the above situation may be phrased as follows:
            %p
              Subsets of some set
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi S
