            %h6 Proof
            %p
              To see this it is sufficient to check commutativity on
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/singleton"} singleton
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subsets"} subsets
              (because every other subset is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/union"} union
              of singletons and, as just remarked,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interactions+of+images+and+pre-images+with+unions+and+intersections"} images and preimages preserve unions
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/singleton"} singleton
              set
